{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.QuarkState.HelicityCommonSource","lean:module:Mathlib.LinearAlgebra.Matrix.Trace","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Matrix.Mul"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.tau_torus_PR_periodic","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.tau_torus_PR_periodic","kind":"theorem","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L206-L212","doc":"**Periodicity.** Under any trace with `y₁₁₁ = 0` (convention D among them), the\nright-line part of `(σ₁σ₂)^N` depends only on `N mod 3`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.twist","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.twist","kind":"theorem","line":194,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L194-L204","doc":"**The full twist** `(σ₁σ₂)³` is `q⁶` on the trivial block, the identity on `(2,1)`,\nand `q⁻⁶` on the sign block. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.S1_mul_S2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.S1_mul_S2","kind":"theorem","line":183,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L183-L192","doc":"`σ₁σ₂` on the blocks. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.conventionD_tau_PR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.conventionD_tau_PR","kind":"theorem","line":176,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L176-L179","doc":"Convention D, explicitly: `τ_D(P_R) = q²/(q²+1)²`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.conventionD_not_kills_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.conventionD_not_kills_right","kind":"theorem","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L171-L174","doc":"**Convention D does not kill the right line**: `y₂₁ = q²/(q²+1)² ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.normalised_eq_augmentation","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.normalised_eq_augmentation","kind":"theorem","line":164,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L164-L169","doc":"With `τ(1) = 1`, a trace that kills the right line is the trivial character, i.e. the\naugmentation `σᵢ ↦ q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.kills_right_iff","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.kills_right_iff","kind":"theorem","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L150-L162","doc":"**The characterisation.** For any set of block elements containing the images of `1`\nand `σ₂` (for instance the image of `H₃(q)`), the trace kills every `x·P_R` iff\n`y₂₁ = y₁₁₁ = 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.weights_zero_of_kills_right","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.weights_zero_of_kills_right","kind":"theorem","line":130,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L130-L148","doc":"**Necessity.** Killing `P_R` and `σ₂·P_R` forces `y₂₁ = y₁₁₁ = 0`, when `[3]_q ≠ 0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.tau_S2_PR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.tau_S2_PR","kind":"theorem","line":125,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L125-L128","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.tau_PR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.tau_PR","kind":"theorem","line":122,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L122-L123","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.trace_kills_right_of","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.trace_kills_right_of","kind":"theorem","line":117,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L117-L120","doc":"**Sufficiency.** With `y₂₁ = y₁₁₁ = 0`, every `x·P_R` has trace zero. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.Pm_S1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.Pm_S1","kind":"theorem","line":104,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L104-L115","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.PR","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.PR","kind":"def","line":101,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L101-L102","doc":"The explicit right-line projector of `σ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.tau","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.tau","kind":"def","line":98,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L98-L99","doc":"The block-weighted trace. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.braid_rel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.braid_rel","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L87-L96","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.S2_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.S2_letter","kind":"theorem","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L76-L85","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.S1_letter","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.S1_letter","kind":"theorem","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L65-L74","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.S2","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.S2","kind":"def","line":62,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L62-L63","doc":"Image of `σ₂`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.S1","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.S1","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L59-L60","doc":"Image of `σ₁`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.Blk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.QuarkState.RightLineTraceObstruction.Blk","kind":"def","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/QuarkState/RightLineTraceObstruction.lean#L56-L57","doc":"The three Wedderburn blocks of `H₃`, as a product ring. ","signatureChunk":0}]}